#. TRANSLATORS: Error message
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_all.rb:76
msgid ""
"No installation control file has been found,\n"
"the installer cannot continue."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ຄວບຄຸມການຕິດຕັ້ງ,\n"
"ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄດ້."

