msgstr "ກຳລັງຂຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າ YaST..."

#. TRANSLATORS: busy message
#. Dialog busy message
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_all.rb:125
#: src/lib/installation/clients/inst_congratulate.rb:271
msgid "Finishing the installation..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງສິ້ນສຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງ..."

#. Somehow the graphical frontend failed and we're running in
#. text mode. Inform the user about this fact.
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_all.rb:173
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"Your computer does not fulfill all requirements for\n"
"a graphical installation. There is either less than %1 MB\n"
"memory or the X server could not be started.\n"
"\n"
"As fallback, the text front-end of YaST2 will guide you\n"
"through the installation. This front-end offers the\n"
"same functionality as the graphical one, but the screens\n"
"differ from those in the manual.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການທັງໝົດສຳລັບ\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບກຣາຟິກ. ມີໜ້ອຍກວ່າ %1 MB\n"
"ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ຫຼື X server ບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີສຳຮອງ, ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບຕົວໜັງສືຂອງ YaST2 ຈະນຳພາທ່ານ\n"
"ຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ສະເໜີ\n"
"ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄືກັນກັບແບບກຣາຟິກ, ແຕ່ໜ້າຈໍ\n"
"ຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄູ່ມື.\n"

#. The script YaST2 wants to inform about a problem with the
#. option no_x11 but it's broken.
#. else if (Installation::no_x11 ())
#. Somehow the graphical frontend failed and we're running in
#. text mode. Inform the user about this fact.
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_all.rb:192
msgid ""
"The graphical interface could not be started.\n"
"\n"
"Either the required packages were not installed (minimal installation) \n"
"or the graphics card is not properly supported.\n"
"\n"
"As fallback, the text front-end of YaST2 will guide you\n"
"through the installation. This front-end offers the\n"
"same functionality as the graphical one, but the screens\n"
"differ from those in the manual.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບກຣາຟິກບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຍ້ອນແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈຳເປັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ (ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ) \n"
"ຫຼື ກາດຈໍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"\n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີສຳຮອງ, ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບຕົວໜັງສືຂອງ YaST2 ຈະນຳພາທ່ານ\n"
"ຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ສະເໜີ\n"
"ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄືກັນກັບແບບກຣາຟິກ, ແຕ່ໜ້າຈໍ\n"
"ຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄູ່ມື.\n"

