msgstr "ກຳລັງດຳເນີນການປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. popup question (#x1)
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_second.rb:354
msgid ""
"The previous installation has failed.\n"
"Would you like it to continue?\n"
"\n"
"Note: You may have to enter some information again."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ຫຼືບໍ່?\n"
"\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງຄືນໃໝ່."

#. popup question (#x1)
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_second.rb:362
msgid ""
"The previous installation has been aborted.\n"
"Would you like it to continue?\n"
"\n"
"Note: You may have to enter some information again."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຖືກຍົກເລີກ.\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ຫຼືບໍ່?\n"
"\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງຄືນໃໝ່."

#. popup headline (#x1)
#. TRANSLATORS: starting the installation process
#. dialog cotent (progress information)
#: src/include/installation/inst_inc_second.rb:376
#: src/lib/installation/clients/inst_doit.rb:60
msgid "Starting Installation..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ..."

#. Text for confirmation popup before the installation really starts
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:119
msgid "Confirm Installation"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:120
msgid "<p>Information required for the base installation is now complete.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງພື້ນຖານແມ່ນຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ.</p>"

#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:121
msgid ""
"<p>If you continue now, partitions on your\n"
"hard disk will be modified according to the installation settings in the\n"
"previous dialogs.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖ້າທ່ານດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນຕອນນີ້, ພາທິຊັນໃນ\n"
"ຮາດດິດຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"ໃນໜ້າຈໍກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.</p>"

#. Text for confirmation popup before the update really starts 3/3
#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:126 src/include/installation/misc.rb:144
#: src/lib/installation/proposal_runner.rb:166
msgid "<p>Go back and check the settings if you are unsure.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ກັບຄືນໄປກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່ ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໝັ້ນໃຈ.</p>"

#. Text for confirmation popup before the update really starts
#.
#. @return [String]
#. Heading for confirmation popup before the update really starts
#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:137
#: src/lib/installation/proposal_runner.rb:154
msgid "Confirm Update"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການອັບເດດ"

#. Text for confirmation popup before the update really starts 1/3
#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:138
#: src/lib/installation/proposal_runner.rb:158
msgid "<p>Information required to perform an update is now complete.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການອັບເດດແມ່ນຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ.</p>"

#. Text for confirmation popup before the update really starts 2/3
#: src/include/installation/misc.rb:139
#: src/lib/installation/proposal_runner.rb:160
msgid ""
"\n"
"<p>If you continue now, data on your hard disk will be overwritten\n"
"according to the settings in the previous dialogs.</p>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<p>ຖ້າທ່ານດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນຕອນນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນໃນຮາດດິດຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ\n"
"ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໜ້າຈໍກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.</p>"

