#. TRANSLATORS: help text
#. TRANSLATORS: help text
#: src/lib/installation/clients/deploy_image_auto.rb:132
#: src/lib/installation/clients/deploying_proposal.rb:68
msgid ""
"<p><b>Installation from Images</b> is used to speed the installation up.\n"
"Images contain compressed snapshots of an installed system matching your\n"
"selection of patterns. The rest of the packages which are not contained in "
"the\n"
"images will be installed from packages the standard way.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກອິເມຈ</b> ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ.\n"
"ອິເມຈຈະບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສະແນບຊັອດ (Snapshots) ທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ\n"
"ຮູບແບບ (Patterns) ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ສ່ວນແພັກເກດອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ\n"
"ອິເມຈ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກແພັກເກດຕາມວິທີມາດຕະຖານ.</p>\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text
#: src/lib/installation/clients/deploying_proposal.rb:75
msgid ""
"<p>Note that when installing from images, the time stamps of all packages "
"originating from the images will\n"
"not match the installation date but rather the date the image was created.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໝາຍເຫດ: ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກອິເມຈ, ເວລາ (Time stamps) ຂອງແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ມາຈາກອິເມຈ\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບວັນທີຕິດຕັ້ງ ແຕ່ຈະກົງກັບວັນທີທີ່ສ້າງອິເມຈນັ້ນຂຶ້ນມາ.</p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text
#: src/lib/installation/clients/deploying_proposal.rb:81
msgid ""
"<p>Installation from images is disabled by default if the current\n"
"pattern selection does not fit any set of images.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກອິເມຈຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຖ້າຫາກ\n"
"ຮູບແບບ (Pattern) ທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ບໍ່ກົງກັບຊຸດອິເມຈໃດໆ ເລີຍ.</p>"

#: src/lib/installation/clients/deploying_proposal.rb:92
#, ycp-format
msgid "Error: Images should not be used for mode: %1."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ອິເມຈສຳລັບໂໝດ: %1."

#. changed to true
#: src/lib/installation/clients/deploying_proposal.rb:121
msgid ""
"Cannot enable installation from images.\n"
"\n"
"Currently selected patterns do not fit the images\n"
"stored on the installation media.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກອິເມຈໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ຮູບແບບ (Patterns) ທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ບໍ່ກົງກັບອິເມຈ\n"
"ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ.\n"

