#. congratulation text 2/4
#: src/lib/installation/clients/inst_congratulate.rb:161
msgid ""
"<p>The installation of &product; on your machine is complete.\n"
"After clicking <b>Finish</b>, you can log in to the system.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ການຕິດຕັ້ງ &product; ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກ <b>ສິ້ນສຸດ</b>, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄດ້.</p>\n"

#. congratulation text 3/4
#: src/lib/installation/clients/inst_congratulate.rb:166
#, ycp-format
